{"n":110,"name":"An-Nasr","nameAr":"النصر","meaning":"The Divine Support","ayahs":3,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"إِذَا جَآءَ نَصْرُ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلْفَتْحُ","en":"When the victory of Allāh has come and the conquest,","w":[{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"When"},{"ar":"جَآءَ","tr":"jāa","en":"comes","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"نَصْرُ","tr":"naṣru","en":"(the) Help","root":"نصر","lem":"نَصْر"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَٱلْفَتْحُ","tr":"wal-fatḥu","en":"and the Victory","root":"فتح","lem":"فَتْح"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَرَأَيْتَ ٱلنَّاسَ يَدْخُلُونَ فِى دِينِ ٱللَّهِ أَفْوَاجًا","en":"And you see the people entering into the religion of Allāh in multitudes,","w":[{"ar":"وَرَأَيْتَ","tr":"wara-ayta","en":"And you see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","tr":"l-nāsa","en":"the people","root":"أنس","lem":"ناس"},{"ar":"يَدْخُلُونَ","tr":"yadkhulūna","en":"entering","root":"دخل","lem":"دَخَلَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"into"},{"ar":"دِينِ","tr":"dīni","en":"(the) religion","root":"دين","lem":"دِين"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"أَفْوَاجًۭا","tr":"afwājan","en":"(in) multitudes","root":"فوج","lem":"فَوْج"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"فَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّكَ وَٱسْتَغْفِرْهُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ تَوَّابًۢا","en":"Then exalt [Him] with praise of your Lord and ask forgiveness of Him. Indeed, He is ever Accepting of Repentance.","w":[{"ar":"فَسَبِّحْ","tr":"fasabbiḥ","en":"Then glorify","root":"سبح","lem":"سَبَّحَ"},{"ar":"بِحَمْدِ","tr":"biḥamdi","en":"with (the) praises","root":"حمد","lem":"حَمْد"},{"ar":"رَبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"(of) your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْهُ ۚ","tr":"wa-is'taghfir'hu","en":"and ask His forgiveness","root":"غفر","lem":"اسْتَغْفَرَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","tr":"innahu","en":"Indeed, He"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"is","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"تَوَّابً